Author: Eric Nguyen <neric@google.com>
Date:   Tue Jan 17 10:07:52 2017 -0800

    Fix a buffer overflow issue where the size was mistakenly much larger
    than it should be.

    prefix_dli was feeding in 'size - 1' instead of 'size - i' to one of its
    functions.
